  {
   "approach": "From the Lupine Meadows trailhead, just south of the Jenny Lake area, the Garnet Canyon trail climbs roughly 6 to 7 miles and about 5,000 ft to the Lower Saddle between the Grand Teton and Middle Teton. The Valhalla Traverse is a system of ledges and slopes that leaves the Lower Saddle and circles the Enclosure. Follow it as for the Black Ice Couloir to the foot of the Black Ice entry. The line is the prominent right-facing corner and ramp system directly below the Vision Quest Couloir.",
